OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aas second glitch causes more disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe technical problem at Prestwick in
OL,7,FAyrshire caused disruption at airports
OL,8,Facross Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,9,Fnorthern England, delaying dozens of
OL,10,Fflights.
OL,12,FNats said a "connectivity issue" was to
OL,13,Fblame for the disruption, and that it
OL,14,Fhad "nothing to do" with a separate
OL,15,Fsoftware defect at Swanwick that led to
OL,16,Fthe cancellation of 2,000 flights
OL,17,Fearlier in September.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
