OL,3,AMerz vows to keep coalition together
OL,4,Afor Germany's 'democratic future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerman Chancellor Friedrich Merz says
OL,7,Fhe will keep his ruling coalition
OL,8,Ftogether for the sake of his country's
OL,9,F"democratic future", following
OL,10,Fresounding defeats for his party in two
OL,11,Fstate elections.
OL,13,F"We are determined to live up to the
OL,14,Fhistoric challenges our country is
OL,15,Ffacing," Merz said, referring to the
OL,16,Fcoalition between his Christian
OL,17,FDemocratic Unionist (CDU) party and the
OL,18,FSocial Democratic Party (SPD).
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
