OL,3,AMillions urged to evacuate as powerful
OL,4,ATyphoon Dujuan hits Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FDujuan has had sustained winds of
OL,7,F130km/h (80.8mph) and gusts of 194
OL,8,Fkm/h. It is the latest in a series of
OL,9,Fstorms in the Pacific, made more
OL,10,Fintense by the "super El Nino", which
OL,11,Fhas warmed the ocean, fuelling the
OL,12,Fformation of storms.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
